COP) - 2018","category":{"index":{"CP01":0,"NRG":1},"label":{"CP01":"Food and non-alcoholic beverages","NRG":"Energy"}}},"geo":{"label":"Geopolitical entity (reporting)","category":{"index":{"BG":0},"label":{"BG":"Bulgaria"}}},"time":{"label":"Time","category":{"index":{"1996-01":0,"1996-02":1,"1996-03":2,"1996-04":3,"1996-05":4,"1996-06":5,"1996-07":6,"1996-08":7,"1996-09":8,"1996-10":9,"1996-11":10,"1996-12":11,"1997-01":12,"1997-02":13,"1997-03":14,"1997-04":15,"1997-05":16,"1997-06":17,"1997-07":18,"1997-08":19,"1997-09":20,"1997-10":21,"1997-11":22,"1997-12":23,"1998-01":24,"1998-02":25,"1998-03":26,"1998-04":27,"1998-05":28,"1998-06":29},"label":{"1996-01":"1996-01","1996-02":"1996-02","1996-03":"1996-03","1996-04":"1996-04","1996-05":"1996-05","1996-06":"1996-06","1996-07":"1996-07","1996-08":"1996-08","1996-09":"1996-09","1996-10":"1996-10","1996-11":"1996-11","1996-12":"1996-12","1997-01":"1997-01","1997-02":"1997-02","1997-03":"1997-03","1997-04":"1997-04","1997-05":"1997-05","1997-06":"1997-06","1997-07":"1997-07","1997-08":"1997-08","1997-09":"1997-09","1997-10":"1997-10","1997-11":"1997-11","1997-12":"1997-12","1998-01":"1998-01","1998-02":"1998-02","1998-03":"1998-03","1998-04":"1998-04","1998-05":"1998-05","1998-06":"1998-06"}}}},"extension":{"lang":"EN","description":"<p>The Harmonised Index of Consumer Prices (HICP) measures price changes of various consumer goods and services over time (inflation). This dataset is compiled according to the European Classification&nbsp;of Individual Consumption&nbsp;According to Purpose (ECOICOP)&nbsp;ver. 2, available in base years 2025=100 and 2015=100.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>This dataset includes&nbsp;four monthly&nbsp;indicators:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>the index, measuring price changes in relation to a base year&nbsp;</li><li>the annual rate of change,&nbsp;representing the percentage change in a reference month compared to the same month of the previous year (also called annual inflation)&nbsp;</li><li>the monthly rate of change,&nbsp;representing the percentage change in consumer price indices in a reference month compared to the previous month (also called monthly inflation)</li><li>the 12-month average rate of change,&nbsp;comparing the average index over a 12-month period to the average index previous 12-month period.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>All the rates are calculated from the monthly HICP indices.&nbsp;</p>","id":"PRC_HICP_MINR","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"PRC_HICP_MINR","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"23.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2026-01-27T09:31:20+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML","title":"<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/PRC_HICP_MINR\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/PRC_HICP_MINR</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2026-01-27</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf","text":"Information note"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_OBJECT_TYPE","title":"DATASET"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_TIMESTAMP_DATA","date":"2026-09-17T11:00:00+0200"},{"ty